// User:         staff Staff[]
// Department:  hrmsDepartments HrmsDepartment[]
// AcademicYear: leaveBalances LeaveBalance[]; leaveRequests LeaveRequest[]; appraisalCycles AppraisalCycle[]
//
// Gaps in the frontend model that the DB design corrects:
//  1. reportingManager is a NAME string -> FK (reportingManagerId); name matching breaks on duplicates/renames.
//  2. Leave days/balances are integers and per-staff only -> Decimal + per academic year (half-day ready).
//  3. Attendance has no unique key -> unique(staffId, attendanceDate).
//  4. Lookups (category, department, leave type) are free strings -> master tables.
//  5. Approver chain is recomputed from names on read (`hydrateLeaveApprovers`) -> persisted
//     currentApproverId + append-only LeaveApprovalStep.
//  6. Shift.assigned is a stored count -> derived from ShiftAssignment.
//
// Not in the frontend yet (intentionally excluded): payroll/salary, recruitment, holidays calendar,
// timesheets. Salary data would need its own access-controlled design and review.
